// ================= Ping An Finance Center (KPF, completed March 2017) =================
// 599.1 m to the top (top floor 555.1 m; Free Sky observation deck on floor 116), Wikipedia / CTBUH. Eight mega-columns
// (paired at the four corners) carry the tower; ~1 700 t of stainless steel clads it (Wikipedia), the piers between the glass are
// chevron-shaped and converge toward the top (New Atlas). The planned 60 m antenna was dropped in 2015, so the top is the short
// stainless pinnacle of the crown. Footprint OSM w535860513: a 76.6 m square whose corners are notched (the mega-column pairs);
// its building parts give the massing used here: the faces flare out at the foot (to 37.9 m half width below ~63 / 120 m), the
// corner columns run straight to ~407 / 467 m, the faces rise as narrowing blades to 557 m, the core to 590 m, the pinnacle to
// 599.1 m. Night: the corner ribs are continuous cool-white light lines, the crown glows, the facade plays the Futian show
