// ================= Shenzhen Energy Mansion (BIG, completed 2018) =================
// Two towers joined by a podium: north tower 42 storeys (218 m architectural, 219.1 m tip), south tower 19 storeys (110 m), the
// connecting block nine storeys (34 m) (Dezeen; Architectural Record; targets.json). The skin is a sawtooth of clear double-glazed
// panes angled 45 degrees in plan (facing NW on the west side, NE on the east side) alternating with rippled white PVDF aluminium
// panels; the pleats swell and flatten in long waves, so the closed (aluminium) side shades the sunnier faces; they split open
// at the entrances (N and S) and pull out into a glazed bulge on the upper west face of the tall tower (Architectural Record).
// Footprints OSM w776897365 (north), w776897367 (link), w776897366 (south). Origin: the middle of the link; +z south.
